hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"296","Saleeb dene ke bare mein: Muhammad ibn Kathir ne hum se bayan kiya, Isra'il ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Haytham ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibrahim al-Taymi se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Uqbah ibn Abi Mu'ayt ko ek darakht se maslub farmaya, us ne kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, kya main Quraysh se alag (muntakhab kiya gaya) hun? Aap ne farmaya: Han, us ne kaha: Phir bachchon ki dekh bhal kaun karega? Aap ne farmaya: Aag."
"297","Uthman ibn Abi Shaybah ne hum se bayan kiya, Waki ne hum se bayan kiya, Jarir ibn Hazim se, al-Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Mushrikon ne ek shakhs ko Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko qatl karne par sone ke uqiya dene ki peshkash ki. Unhon ne kaha: Pas Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne use pakad liya aur use Madinah ke ek pahad par saleeb par chadha diya jise Dhubab kaha jata hai; woh Islam mein sab se pehla saleeb diya gaya shakhs tha."
